   {
    "en": "Contract Romance for an Ending"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "One failed marriage was enough for Sungyoon to give up on romance. But when he's suddenly reunited with his old friend — and now successful author — Hyunsoo, an opportunity arises: A contract relationship in order to inspire Hyunsoo to finish his new romance novel! Is this no strings attached deal a perfect outlet for Sungyoon's loneliness? Or will he risk developing real feelings again?"
  },
